Subject: [PATCH 09/11] cuda: GGUF (ggml) fused dequant matmul for qwen3_5 (P26
 #2)

Add layout=ggml QLinear that keeps raw q8_0/q4_k/q5_k/q6_k blocks resident and
dequantizes inside the Triton matmul kernel (tensorfold ggml()), instead of
pre-converting weights to bf16. MLP/attention/lm_head projections now load as
raw GGUF blocks; GDN (linear_attn.*, needs V-head reorder), embeddings and
F32/F16 tensors stay on the dense path. Verified on GB10: 4/4 kernel types match
the CPU dequantizer, and Qwen3.5-0.8B-Q4_K_M.gguf serves coherent output end-to-end.
